msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Project Bin"
msgstr "Dokumentácia Kdenlive - Zásobník projektu"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, project bin, working, documentation, user manual, video "
"editor, open source, free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, zásobník projektu, práca, dokumentácia, používateľská "
"príručka, video editor, open source, zadarmo, naučiť sa, jednoduché"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:25
msgid "Project Bin"
msgstr "Projektový kôš"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:42
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The Project Bin\\ [1]_ is a view in Kdenlive which lists all the :term:"
#| "`assets<Asset>` (clips) that are associated with the project. You can "
#| "drag files from your OS file manager to the bin, or use the :doc:`Media "
#| "Browser</project_and_asset_management/media_browser>`."
msgid ""
"The Project Bin\\ [1]_ is a view in Kdenlive which lists all the :term:"
"`assets <Asset>` (clips) that are associated with the project. You can drag "
"files from your OS file manager to the bin, or use the :doc:`Media Browser </"
"project_and_asset_management/media_browser>`."
msgstr ""
"Zásobník projektu\\ [1]_ je zobrazenie v Kdenlive, ktoré uvádza všetky :term:"
"`aktíva<Asset>` (klipy) spojené s projektom. Súbory môžete presúvať zo "
"správcu súborov operačného systému do zásobníka alebo použiť :doc:"
"`Prehliadač médií</project_and_asset_management/media_browser>`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:44
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "It is good practice to use :doc:`folders</project_and_asset_management/"
#| "project_bin/project_bin_use_folders>`, :doc:`tags</"
#| "project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_tags>`, and "
#| "even :doc:`multiple bins</project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
#| "project_bin_use_multiple_bins>` to stay organized and have quick and "
#| "structured access to all assets of the project."
msgid ""
"It is good practice to use :doc:`folders </project_and_asset_management/"
"project_bin/project_bin_use_folders>`, :doc:`tags </"
"project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_tags>`, and even :"
"doc:`multiple bins </project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
"project_bin_use_multiple_bins>` to stay organized and have quick and "
"structured access to all assets of the project."
msgstr ""
"Je dobrou praxou používať :doc:`priečinky</project_and_asset_management/"
"project_bin/project_bin_use_folders>`, :doc:`štítky</"
"project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_tags>` a dokonca :"
"doc:`viacnásobné zásobníky</project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
"project_bin_use_multiple_bins>` na udržanie poriadku a rýchly a "
"štruktúrovaný prístup ku všetkým aktívam projektu."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:56
msgid "The initial Project Bin in Kdenlive"
msgstr "Úvodný zásobník projektu v Kdenlive"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:58
msgid ""
"This is how the project bin looks when you start Kdenlive or create a new "
"project. Note the **Sequence** folder that is there always and will hold all "
"sequences you create."
msgstr ""
"Takto vyzerá zásobník projektu, keď spustíte Kdenlive alebo vytvoríte nový "
"projekt. Všimnite si priečinok **Sekvencia**, ktorý je vždy prítomný a bude "
"obsahovať všetky sekvencie, ktoré vytvoríte."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:60
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The bin essentially consists of the toolbar and the list space. See the "
#| "project bin :doc:`layout</project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
#| "project_bin_use>` for more details."
msgid ""
"The bin essentially consists of the toolbar and the list space. See the "
"project bin :doc:`layout </project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
"project_bin_use>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Zásobník pozostáva v podstate z panela nástrojov a priestoru zoznamu. Viac "
"podrobností nájdete v :doc:`rozložení</project_and_asset_management/"
"project_bin/project_bin_use>` zásobníka projektu."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:71
msgid "An example Project Bin in Kdenlive"
msgstr "Ukážka zásobníka projektu v Kdenlive"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:73
msgid ""
"This is how the project bin looks with several assets of different types "
"imported, a sequence created, and several folders created by the user."
msgstr ""
"Takto vyzerá zásobník projektu s importovanými viacerými aktívami rôznych "
"typov, vytvorenou sekvenciou a viacerými priečinkami vytvorenými "
"používateľom."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:75
msgid ""
"From here, you drag the clips into the timeline. Selecting a clip brings it "
"automatically into the Clip Monitor."
msgstr ""
"Odtiaľto preťahujete klipy na časovú os. Výberom klipu sa automaticky "
"zobrazí v monitore klipov."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin.rst:77
#, fuzzy
